# Generated, disposable output: anything a tool writes and `make clean` can
# delete. Keep new tooling pointed here rather than beside its sources, so
# `git status` stays quiet and "delete the generated stuff" is always a safe
# `rm -rf out`. (VHS review frames and the review fingerd live here.)
/out/
